# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 5/5, item 43
# Base: apply after 0042.
#
# Replaces static column split with measured EWMA partial throughput.
# Each card's observed Q4_K columns/sec determines future block ownership.
# Split stays aligned to legal 256-element Q4_K blocks.
#
# Env:
#   DEEP2_COLUMN_SPLIT_AUTO=0  disables adaptation
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0043_adaptive_column_split_ewma.patch

